we got a legitimate business called Enterprises

function double n
    here's your cut n * 2
stop

let d be do me a favor double 21
say d

thing Associate
    let respect be 0
    let cash be 0

    initiation startingCash
        let yours truly's cash be startingCash
    stop

    function collectDebt amount
        increase yours truly's cash by amount
        here's your cut yours truly's cash
    stop
stop

thing Capo answers to Associate
    let crew be 0

    function greet
        say "I run this crew."
    stop
stop

let tony be a new Associate 100
say tony's cash

let paid be use tony to do me a favor collectDebt 50
say paid
say tony's cash

let vinny be a new Capo 200
use vinny to do me a favor greet
say vinny's cash

use vinny to do me a favor collectDebt 10
say vinny's cash

whack tony
say tony's cash
say tony's respect

destroy tony
say tony's cash
